    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tlxq](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tlxq) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Aug 19 2026 53km NE of Ruteng. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -8.1769 longitude 120.6643. It impacted 236907 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
